---
import Icon from '../icons/Icon.astro';
---
<section class="split rv" id="governance">
  <div class="l"><p class="eye">Governance</p><h2 class="d2">Your ethical screens, <br><em>enforced once,</em> <br><em>everywhere.</em></h2><p class="d2s max">Your wall-management system stays the source of truth. Lucio enforces what it says.</p>
    <p class="p" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:46ch">Every read and write, from any client, passes through one governed interface. Screens are enforced there, not re-implemented in each tool. Every decision is logged.</p></div>
  <div class="r">
    <ol class="ladder" aria-label="Lucio app, Lucio Capsule and your tools sit as equal peers above one governed interface, fed by your wall-management system, above the document store">
      <li><div><span class="k">Peers · equal distance</span><h3 class="h3">Lucio app · Capsule · Your tools</h3><p class="small">The app is a client like the rest. Nothing sits closer to the data.</p></div><span class="arrow"><Icon name="arrow-down" /></span></li>
      <li class="band"><div><h3 class="h3">One governed interface</h3><p class="small">Every read and write passes here. Screens and tiers live on this band, not in the clients.</p></div><div class="tiers"><span>Lister</span><span>Viewer</span><span>Editor</span><span>Admin</span></div></li>
      <li><div><span class="k">Feeds the band</span><h3 class="h3">Your wall-management system</h3><p class="small">Source of truth for screens.</p></div><span class="arrow"><Icon name="arrow-up" /></span></li>
      <li><div><span class="k">Beneath</span><h3 class="h3">Document store</h3><p class="small">Your region. Your matters. Your walls.</p></div><span></span></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="chips"><span>SOC 2 Type II</span><span>ISO 27001</span><span>Audit on every action</span><span>Data resident: US · UK · IN</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
